{"articleNo":"2384","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2384&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009 교육역량강화사업 멘티 결과보고서 제출 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.12.07","hit":"13608","attachments":[{"name":"멘티참여보고서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2384&attachNo=2702"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">멘티 참여 결과보고서 제출 안내</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2009년도 교육역량강화사업 멘토지원 사업과 관련하여 결과보고서 제출시에</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 『</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">멘티 참여 결과보고서』제출을 추가로 안내하오니, 멘티로 참여하는 학생도</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 붙임 결과보고서를 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;☞ 제출방법은 멘토가 결과보고서 제출시에 같이 제출 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-